# OmacOS wallpaper provenance manifest
# theme|render-url|artwork|license
#
# All works are public domain (pre-1929 or explicitly PD). Render URLs target
# a <=3840px-wide JPEG derivative via Wikimedia Commons thumbnail service or
# the original file when already within budget.
#
# Run tools/fetch-wallpapers.sh to regenerate themes/*/wallpaper.jpg from these URLs.

